  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="HHFF9F4E3640A578CDF5DE55A091A9A0F9" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;1) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;2) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;3) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;4) The Company is involved in various litigation arising from the normal operations of its pipeline business. The Company, based on the advice of counsel, believes that any adverse findings with respect to such legal actions will not result in a material effect on the financial position of the Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;5) Not Applicable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phillips 66 Sweeny-Freeport LLC is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC").&amp;#160; The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by the FERC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Operator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respondent has no employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respondent's properties are operated by Phillips 66 Pipeline LLC as agent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phillips 66 Sweeny-Freeport LLC Legal Entity Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phillips 66 Sweeny-Freeport LLC (Sweeny-Freeport) was incorporated January 7, 2014.&amp;#160; Sweeny-Freeport consists of NGL pipelines in the Sweeny/Freeport Texas area.&amp;#160; Shippers can move barrels from a Fractionator in the Phillips 66 Sweeny Refinery complex to caverns at Clemens, to Stratton Ridge, and Mont Belvieu, and to the Freeport Marine Terminal.&amp;#160; Construction took place from 2014 to 2016 and totals 252 miles of pipe in service.&amp;#160; Tariffs were initially effective on September 25, 2015.&amp;#160; Pipeline start-up was phased from September through November 2015, with the official"In-Operation" date for the Fractionator of December 1, 2015.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
